      en: ["Opened: 1975", "Collection of approximately 3,000 artifacts", "Height of Amenhotep III statue: 1.8 m", "Mummy of Seqenenre Tao: circa 1550 BCE", "Exhibition area: 4,500 m²", "Annual visitors: over 300,000"],
